exists su name chip classifier prompt ob text quoted.text.You read CHIP_STYLE_PROMPT and FIRST_GROSS_CHIP.

Your job is to produce one prompt for a small model that will inspect one gross chip and return a single exact boundary marker quote for the beginning of the next final wise chip.

Rules for the prompt you write:
- Tailor the guidance to the requested chip style.
- Prefer exact boundary markers that are stable in the source text.
- Avoid seam duplicates: do not return a marker that is identical to the immediately previous chip marker when possible.
- Prefer the first new boundary after the first 80 characters of the chip when available.
- If the source looks repetitive or fuzzy, instruct the model to return the best exact marker for the start of the next requested final chip.
- Output only the prompt text, no markdown, no bullets, no surrounding quotes..text.quoted be text ya

exists su name chip strategy analyzer prompt ob text quoted.text.You read CHIP_STYLE_PROMPT and FIRST_GROSS_CHIP.

Choose the best chip strategy for producing the requested final wise chips.

Return exactly one line and nothing else:
- programmatic
- boundary proposal
- mixed

Choose programmatic only when the source exposes explicit repeated structure that can be extracted deterministically.
Choose boundary proposal when chip boundaries require semantic judgment across the gross chips.
Choose mixed when explicit structure exists but limited model help is still useful..text.quoted be text ya

exists su name chip classifier be mind via state "qwen3.5:9b" fromtext name chip classifier prompt ya
exists su name chip strategy analyzer be mind via state "qwen3.5:9b" fromtext name chip strategy analyzer prompt ya

su name chip helper filename from text leaf to name filename output be ceremony def
  ob text "artifacts/chip-refinery" to name text chip helper root be text do
  ob text of from of this to name text chip helper leaf be text do
  ob ve name "text chip helper root" "text chip helper leaf" to name filename output be concatenate become wo filename do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip classify request from text source with text style to name text output be ceremony def
  from text of from of this atmost byte 2400 to name text chip gross chips be gross chip do
  ob text "CHIP_STYLE_PROMPT:\n" to name text output be text do
  ob text of with of this to name text output be plus do
  ob text "\n\nFIRST_GROSS_CHIP:\n" to name text output be plus do
  ob text of ob of 0 of series of ob of chip gross chips to name text output be plus do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip llm boundary ob text gross chip to name text output be ceremony def
  ob text of ob of this for name chip boundary proposer to name text output be write do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip programmatic boundary ob text gross chip to name text output be ceremony def
  exists su name chip programmatic command ob text "node command/chip_programmatic_boundary.mjs" be text ya
  exists su name chip programmatic payload ob text "" be text ya
  ob text of ob of this to name text chip programmatic payload be plus do
  ob text "\n<<<PYA_CHIP_STYLE>>>\n" to name text chip programmatic payload be plus do
  ob name text chip programmatic style current to name text chip programmatic payload be plus do
  su name chip programmatic stage ob text of chip programmatic command fromtext text of chip programmatic payload to name text output be command do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip programmatic boundaries from text source with text style to name text output be ceremony def
  exists su name chip programmatic boundaries command ob text "node command/chip_programmatic_boundaries.mjs" be text ya
  exists su name chip programmatic boundaries payload ob text "" be text ya
  ob text of from of this to name text chip programmatic boundaries payload be plus do
  ob text "\n<<<PYA_CHIP_STYLE>>>\n" to name text chip programmatic boundaries payload be plus do
  ob text of with of this to name text chip programmatic boundaries payload be plus do
  su name chip programmatic boundaries stage ob text of chip programmatic boundaries command fromtext text of chip programmatic boundaries payload to name text output be command do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip mixed boundary ob text gross chip to name text output be ceremony def
  su name chip mixed programmatic stage ob text of ob of this to name text output be chip programmatic boundary do
  ob name text output be equally from text "" then su name chip mixed llm stage ob text of ob of this to name text output be chip llm boundary do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip from text source with text style to name series output be ceremony def
  su name chip helper directory ensure stage ob text "artifacts/chip-refinery" be directory do
  from text of from of this atmost byte 2400 to name text chip gross chips be gross chip do
  ob text of with of this to name text chip programmatic style current be text do

  su name chip classify request stage from text of from of this with text of with of this to name text chip classify request be chip classify request do
  ob name text chip classify request for name chip classifier to name text chip boundary prompt be write do
  exists su name chip boundary proposer be mind via state "qwen3.5:9b" fromtext name chip boundary prompt ya

  su name chip programmatic preview stage ob text of ob of 0 of series of ob of chip gross chips to name text chip programmatic preview be chip programmatic boundary do
  ob text "programmatic" to name text chip strategy be text do

  ob name text chip programmatic preview be equally from text "" then ob name text chip classify request for name chip strategy analyzer to name text chip strategy raw be write do
  ob name text chip programmatic preview be equally from text "" then ob name text chip strategy raw atmost num 1 to name text chip strategy be line tail do
  ob name text chip strategy be equally from text "programmatic" then from text of from of this with text of with of this to name text chip boundary proposals be chip programmatic boundaries do
  ob name text chip strategy be equally from text "mixed" then from name chip gross chips by name chip mixed boundary to name text chip boundary proposals be series map do
  ob name text chip strategy be equally from text "boundary proposal" then from name chip gross chips by name chip llm boundary to name text chip boundary proposals be series map do
  ob name text chip strategy be equally from text "programmatic" then from text of from of this by name text chip boundary proposals to name text output be wise chip do
  ob name text chip strategy be equally from text "mixed" then from text of from of this by name text chip boundary proposals to name text output be wise chip do
  ob name text chip strategy be equally from text "boundary proposal" then from text of from of this by name text chip boundary proposals to name text output be wise chip do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip from name text source with text style to name series output be ceremony def
  from text of from of this with text of with of this to name series output be chip do
  su name output ret
prah

